    <rule id="7ccf-205f-4b7a-a1f0-45e2d" name="Company Command" page="156" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>One Scout Sentinel or Armoured Sentinel in this Formation must be designated the Command Sentinel. That model gains the Character unit type, and can issue the 'Take Aim!', 'Forwards, for the Emperor!' or 'Move! Move! Move!' order to a unit in its Formation as though it were an officer. Units from this Formation count as having a Leadership characteristic of 8 for the purposes of the test to see if the order has been understood.</description>
    </rule>
