    <rule id="4e6e4c43-6df1-cadc-2b42-589d9b0e31f6-45e2d" name="Deathstrike Vortex Missile" page="0" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>One use, indirect only. 
After determining the final position of the marker, any models and removable terrain touched by the blast are removed from the game (flyers are unaffected).
No saves or special saving rules of any type.
Gargantuan Creatures automatically lose D6 Wounds.
Super Heavy vehicles automatically lose D3 Structure Points.

After the initial damge is resolved, the vortex partially collapses. Replace the 10" marker with the 3".
At the beginning of every following player turn (both sides) the vortex scatters 2D6". After determining the final position of the marker, resolve damage as above. If a double is rolled for the distance, remove the vortex instead.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule id="0848b56e-5107-5806-dd4e-4a01c7409607-45e2d" name="Dedicated Hunters" page="0" hidden="false">
