    <rule id="4f36ed35-1c20-77b5-784f-5fc1d958e36e-45e2d" name="Orbital Cannon" page="0" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>A Defence Laser can forgo its usual shooting in order to neutralise an opponent's off-table support.

Declare the Orbital Cannon option is being used when the enemy attempts to use one of the following Strategic Assets and roll to hit using the Defence Laser's usual BS:
Orbital Bombardment, Scheduled Bombardment, Precision Strike, Blind Barrage.
If a hit is scored the Strategic Asset is neutralised for the rest of the game. If the Defence Laser misses, the Strategic Asset may be used as normal.</description>
    </rule>
