      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>Battlegroup Hammerblow's Militarum Tempestus Scions must begin the game embarked upon the formation's Valkyrie. Instead of making Reserve rolls for the Valkyrie, at the start of any of your turns (including the first) you may have it arrive from Deep Strike Reserve. It will not scatter if placed within 12" of the Scout Sentinel Squadron from this formation.</description>
