    <rule id="8b069627-b9d3-187d-b2b9-2499c10eba96-45e2d" name="Sniper Cover" page="0" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>Instead of door gunners with Heavy Bolters, Col Paseski's crew includes a pair of master snipers, 1 on each side door. Their Sniper Rifles may always fire, even if not normally allowed to, and may engage any enemy unit they can see, not only those fired at by Steel Eagles other weapons.
Once per game, you may declare a single 'champion' shot to be fired by each sniper. This rolls to hit as normal, S10, AP1, 2D6 armour pen. The snipers may be lost as a result of a Weapon Destroyed damage result (one per result).</description>
    </rule>
