    <rule id="7e2e-6484-46c2-de39-45e2d" name="Target Sighted" page="158" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>Once per turn, in your Shooting phase, one friendly model equipped with a vox-caster can call in target coordinates. Choose an enemy unit within 18" and in line of sight of that model. Until the end of the phase, models from this Formation count their weapons as Twin-linked when firing at that enemy unit.</description>
    </rule>
