    <rule id="1ba7-dbc9-6d0f-fbff-0f066" name="Wing Leader (Valkyrie)" page="76" hidden="false">
      <profiles />
      <rules />
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <description>Wing Leaders are free upgrades for Flyers. One model in each Flyer Wing can be upgraded to a Wing Leader at no additional points cost. At the start of any game, immediately after determining your Warlord Trait, roll on the Wing Leader table relevant to their Faction for each Wing Leader to determine their special rule.

1-2 Formation Flying: If the Flyer Wing started the Movement phase in an Attack Pattern, the Wing Leader, and models from their Flyer Wing, can move an extra 3" and automatically pass Break Turn tests.

3-4 Stay on Target: The Wing Leader, and models from their Flyer Wing, can re-roll To Wound and Armour Penetration rolls of 1 if they are in an Attack Pattern.

5-6 Break! Break! Break!: The Wing Leader, and models from their Flyer Wing, can re-roll failed saves when they Jink if they are in an Attack Pattern when the saving throw is made.</description>
    </rule>
